      "amount": "1/2 teaspoon"
    },
    {
      "name": "vegetable oil",
      "amount": "2 tablespoons"
    }
  ],
  "instructions": [
    "Heat the oil in a large pan over medium heat.",
    "Add the chicken to the pan and cook until browned on all sides.",
    "Add the curry powder, bay leaves, salt, and pepper to the pan and stir to combine.",
    "Cook for 1 minute, until the spices are fragrant.",
    "Add the coconut cream, lime juice, and brown sugar to the pan and stir to combine.",
    "Bring the mixture to a simmer and cook until the chicken is cooked through.",
    "Remove the bay leaves from the pan and serve the curry hot.",
    "Garnish with chopped fresh herbs, if desired.",
    "Serve over rice or with naan bread.",
    "Refrigerate or freeze leftovers for up to 3 days."
  ],
